    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.poster.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.webm?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.mp4?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Prepare During the Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up to 4 friends and work together to strategically plan. Upgrade your hero\u2019s skills each day, and gather resources to upgrade a variety of weapons in preparation for the deadly nights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.poster.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.webm?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.mp4?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you have prepared enough. The night brings high-intensity survival. Blast through waves of deadly zombies and elite bosses by working together with your squad. Rely on your friends and their distinct classes: Tank DPS and Healer, and make it to another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/83841e3c1754160747c630f76e772fb6.avif?t=1755711579\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.poster.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.webm?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.mp4?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Survive in two modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Scenario Mode: Explore the apocalyptic world and characters by progressing through story-driven stages with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Challenge Mode: Truly test your skills and survive as long as you can against never-ending waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/b0fa99f718ef167e029a1833a4b2e292.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Under Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Squad is a work in progress. New features, such as Hero Traits and Customization, are currently in development, and these features may be subject to change in the future. <br><br>Thank you for your support and understanding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.poster.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.webm?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.mp4?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Prepare During the Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up to 4 friends and work together to strategically plan. Upgrade your hero\u2019s skills each day, and gather resources to upgrade a variety of weapons in preparation for the deadly nights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.poster.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.webm?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.mp4?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you have prepared enough. The night brings high-intensity survival. Blast through waves of deadly zombies and elite bosses by working together with your squad. Rely on your friends and their distinct classes: Tank DPS and Healer, and make it to another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/83841e3c1754160747c630f76e772fb6.avif?t=1755711579\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.poster.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.webm?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.mp4?t=1755711579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Survive in two modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Scenario Mode: Explore the apocalyptic world and characters by progressing through story-driven stages with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Challenge Mode: Truly test your skills and survive as long as you can against never-ending waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/b0fa99f718ef167e029a1833a4b2e292.avif?t=1755711579\" width=600 height=314 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Under Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Squad is a work in progress. New features, such as Hero Traits and Customization, are currently in development, and these features may be subject to change in the future. <br><br>Thank you for your support and understanding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
